226
00:09:40,914 --> 00:09:43,316
Actually, other leaves can be used too!

227
00:09:43,316 --> 00:09:46,186
In Taiwan, people mostly use bamboo leaves or shell ginger leaves

228
00:09:46,186 --> 00:09:48,321
In other countries, people also use banana leaves

229
00:09:48,321 --> 00:09:50,457
