263
00:11:01,461 --> 00:11:03,196
Just the right amount is best

264
00:11:07,934 --> 00:11:09,335
It's time for today's

265
00:11:09,335 --> 00:11:11,137
Food Facts!

266
00:11:15,808 --> 00:11:18,144
Long ago, zongzi were originally used as offerings

267
00:11:18,144 --> 00:11:20,079
