276
00:11:36,696 --> 00:11:38,565
shredded pork, and other delicious fillings!

277
00:11:39,699 --> 00:11:41,634
The Chinese words for wrapping zongzi sound like "passing an exam"

278
00:11:41,634 --> 00:11:43,903
so many people eat zongzi before exams

279
00:11:43,903 --> 00:11:45,638
